  "description": "Houses on a street hold `nums[i]` money. You can't take from two **adjacent** houses. Return the most money you can collect.\n\n### Input\n- Line 1: `nums`, space-separated integers.\n\n### Output\nOne integer.\n\n### Constraints\n- `1 <= nums.length <= 8000`\n- `0 <= nums[i] <= 400`",
  "signature": {
    "params": [
      {
        "name": "nums",
        "type": "int[]"
      }
    ],
    "returns": "int"
  },
